{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"First, use the power rule:\n\n$\\begin{align}\\displaystyle\\int^{-2}_{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{16-x^3}{x^3}\\right)\\,dx~\u0026=~\\displaystyle\\int^{-2}_{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{16}{x^3}-\\dfrac{x^3}{x^3}\\right)\\,dx\n\\\\\u0026=~\\displaystyle\\int^{-2}_{-1}\\left(16{x^{-3}}-{1}\\right)\\,dx\n\\\\\u0026=(-8x^{-2}-x)\\Bigg|^\\blueD{-2}_{\\maroonD{-1}}\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Second, plug in the limits of integration:\n\n$[-8\\cdot(\\blueD{-2})^{-2}-(\\blueD{-2})]-[-8\\cdot(\\maroonD{-1})^{-2}-(\\maroonD{-1})] = 0+7 = 7$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The answer:\n\n$\\displaystyle\\int^{-2}_{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{16-x^3}{x^3}\\right)\\,dx= 7$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Evaluate the definite integral.**\n\n$\\displaystyle\\int^{-2}_{-1}\\left(\\dfrac{16-x^3}{x^3}\\right)\\,dx = $ [[☃ numeric-input 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"numeric-input 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answers":[{"maxError":null,"message":"","simplify":"required","status":"correct","strict":false,"value":7}],"coefficient":false,"labelText":"","size":"normal","static":false},"static":false,"type":"numeric-input","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
